cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Two-Site Solar PV Inverter & Weather Dataset (Romania)"
abstract: >-
  Hourly and 5-minute AC power generation data from two grid-connected,
  50 kWp-class solar PV systems in southwestern Romania, each equipped with a
  Huawei SUN2000 string inverter, joined with matched historical weather
  (Open-Meteo) and solar position. Released for research on short-term PV power
  forecasting.
type: dataset
authors:
